  "messages": [
    {
      "id": 0,
      "offset": "YES_NO",
      "block_type": "sel",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Yes.\nNo.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "offset": "GARD_BATTLE",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "All entry is forbidden.\nLeave now, or face termination.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "offset": "GARDBT_OR_N",
      "block_type": "sel",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Get out of my way.\n...I understand.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "offset": "arujila_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "What is this?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "offset": "arujila_05a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Jinana's men will be heading out,\nsoon.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "offset": "arujila_05b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "If we don't hurry, we'll be left behind.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "offset": "arujila_06",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I wonder if leaving Jinana there was\nright...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "offset": "arujila_06_SEL",
      "block_type": "sel",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "She's risen to the clouds by now.\nIt seems we're forgetting something.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "offset": "arujila_06_ans0",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Those who die rise to the clouds\nand fall back to the Junkyard\nas rain.\nThat's natural...\nBut, it feels like I'm forgetting\nsomething important.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "offset": "arujila_06_ans1",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I know. Isn't there... something you do\nwhen a person dies?\nAnd, why does my... chest hurt?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "offset": "arujila_08",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I'm an idiot for letting someone\nlike him trick me again...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "offset": "arujila_09",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I still don't like devouring...\nBut, how can we fight if we lose\nour powers?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "offset": "schro_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "> It's that animal.\n> It peers at you through deep,\nsilver eyes.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "offset": "schro_02",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "> It's that animal.\n> It peers at you through deep,\nsilver eyes.",
