      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "> It's that animal.\n> It peers at you through deep,\nsilver eyes.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "offset": "schro_04",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "> It's that animal.\n> It peers at you through deep,\nsilver eyes.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "offset": "schro_05",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "> It's that animal.\n> Looking closely, you can see\na strange bell around its neck.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "offset": "schro_06",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "> It's that animal.\n> Its eyes seem to be filled with\ncompassion for Argilla.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
